WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.838 --> 00:00:15.194
More angry dolls piled onto Roxy and Terrell.

2
00:00:15.195 --> 00:00:20.026
Chuckles giggled. "Good-bye, Rocket Girl!"

3
00:00:20.027 --> 00:00:23.510
"You won't get away!" Roxy shouted.

4
00:00:23.511 --> 00:00:26.114
"Yes, I will," Chuckles said.

5
00:00:26.115 --> 00:00:27.902
"I got away from Chuck.

6
00:00:27.903 --> 00:00:30.426
He didn't make much money, so I left.

7
00:00:30.427 --> 00:00:35.635
Now I'll create a huge doll army and steal money, money, money!"

8
00:00:35.636 --> 00:00:38.901
Chuckles ran out of the store.

9
00:00:38.902 --> 00:00:42.399
"Grr!" Roxy pushed away some of the dolls.

10
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.523
Other dolls jumped onto her and Terrell.

11
00:00:45.524 --> 00:00:49.184
"Rocket Girl, do something!" Terrell said.

12
00:00:49.185 --> 00:00:53.598
"I have an idea," Roxy stared at the dolls on top of her.

13
00:00:53.599 --> 00:00:56.780
Orange beams radiated from her eyes.

14
00:00:56.781 --> 00:00:58.781
The dolls began to melt.

15
00:00:58.782 --> 00:01:04.522
Soon a puddle of melted plastic covered the floor.

16
00:01:04.523 --> 00:01:07.167
"Awesome!" Terrell said.

17
00:01:07.168 --> 00:01:12.119
Jack and Mara ran over. "Rocket Girl!" Mara said.

18
00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:17.427
"I have to go!" Roxy said. Zoom!

19
00:01:17.428 --> 00:01:22.084
Roxy saw Chuckles a few blocks away.

20
00:01:22.085 --> 00:01:27.704
He opened a taxi door, pulled out the driver, and jumped in.

21
00:01:27.705 --> 00:01:30.636
Tires spun as the taxi raced away.

22
00:01:30.637 --> 00:01:34.578
The driver shook his fist. "Rotten doll!"

23
00:01:34.579 --> 00:01:39.601
The taxi swerved onto the sidewalk.

24
00:01:39.602 --> 00:01:43.033
"Ahh!" A man jumped out of the way.

25
00:01:43.034 --> 00:01:46.132
Bam! Chuckles drove through a fruit stand.

26
00:01:46.133 --> 00:01:50.790
"This is fun, fun, fun!"

27
00:01:50.791 --> 00:01:56.493
Roxy stopped the taxi and grabbed Chuckles.

28
00:01:56.494 --> 00:01:58.652
The doll bit her.

29
00:01:58.653 --> 00:02:01.572
"Ouch!" Roxy pulled her hand away.

30
00:02:01.573 --> 00:02:04.947
"Chomp, chomp, chomp!" Chuckles ran away.

31
00:02:04.948 --> 00:02:09.660
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams hit Chuckles' wooden leg.

32
00:02:09.661 --> 00:02:11.880
The leg started to smoke.

33
00:02:11.881 --> 00:02:16.900
Chuckles gulped. "This is bad, bad, bad!"

34
00:02:16.901 --> 00:02:19.121
A woman had a water bottle.

35
00:02:19.122 --> 00:02:22.506
Chuckles grabbed the bottle and poured the water on his leg.

36
00:02:22.507 --> 00:02:25.002
"Much better!" he said.

37
00:02:25.003 --> 00:02:27.795
Roxy hurried over and grabbed Chuckles.

38
00:02:27.796 --> 00:02:32.423
"Let me go!" The doll kicked as Roxy flipped him over.

39
00:02:32.424 --> 00:02:37.251
She found the computer chip and ripped it out.

40
00:02:37.252 --> 00:02:44.378
Chuckles stopped moving. Roxy wiped her brow. "Whew!"

41
00:02:44.379 --> 00:02:47.036
The valuable dolls weren't alive anymore.

42
00:02:47.037 --> 00:02:49.646
Roxy brought them back to the convention center.

43
00:02:49.647 --> 00:02:51.816
The man in the green suit smiled.

44
00:02:51.817 --> 00:02:55.980
"You're my hero, Rocket Girl!"

45
00:02:55.981 --> 00:02:59.834
Next Roxy brought Chuckles to Chuck.

46
00:02:59.835 --> 00:03:02.845
"I took out the chip," Roxy said.

47
00:03:02.846 --> 00:03:05.318
"Thanks, Rocket Girl," Chuck said.

48
00:03:05.319 --> 00:03:07.384
He pretended Chuckles was talking.

49
00:03:07.385 --> 00:03:09.682
"You're super, Rocket Girl!"

50
00:03:09.683 --> 00:03:14.386
"Um, your lips are moving," Roxy said.

51
00:03:14.387 --> 00:03:17.127
At Downtown Toys, Roxy found her friends.

52
00:03:17.128 --> 00:03:19.476
"You missed it, Roxy!" Jack said.

53
00:03:19.477 --> 00:03:21.652
"There was an evil doll!"

54
00:03:21.653 --> 00:03:26.253
Terrell grinned. "But Rocket Girl stopped it."

55
00:03:26.254 --> 00:03:28.964
"Wow." Roxy turned to Mara.

56
00:03:28.965 --> 00:03:31.096
"Did you pick a gift for Dina yet?"

57
00:03:31.097 --> 00:03:33.403
"Nope," Mara said.

58
00:03:33.404 --> 00:03:39.621
"But I know what I'm not getting for her—a doll!"
